# Feature delivery

When implementing **user-facing** behavior in this app:

## UI

- Before new components, check `src/components/` and existing routes for reusable pieces; extend them when possible.

## Product analytics

- Instrument meaningful actions (auth, core flows, primary CTAs) with stable event names and non-PII properties.
- If a `track` / `trackEvent` helper exists, use it; otherwise add `src/lib/analytics.ts` and wire to Posthog/Vercel/etc. per project docs — avoid leaving features permanently uninstrumented.

## Monitoring and errors

- Surface async failures to the user; log or report with enough context to debug. Align with whatever error reporting the stack uses when present.

For the full playbook (copy into prompts): GOLD `docs/feature-agent-playbook.md` if you use the shared monorepo.
